# The repo holds the PROGRAM, never a working board. A saved board is the program and the budget
# data fused into one file, so a stray copy dropped in here must not be stageable by accident.
*.html
# One build since v1.88: the card build (prioritization-board.html) was retired and is no longer an
# exception, so a copy dropped back in cannot be committed by accident.
!prioritization-board-grid.html

# Working files
*.xlsx
*.pptx
*.json
!package.json
# Named one by one on purpose, like the boards above: a stray state file dropped in tools/
# must still be unstageable by accident.
# The controls a user reaches for one requirement, recorded so one cannot vanish unnoticed (row-controls.mjs).
!tools/row-controls.json
# Which surface states which quantity, pinned so a figure that vanishes off a briefing product
# fails the trace matrix instead of scoring as silence. Regenerate with trace-matrix.mjs --emit.
!tools/trace-stated.json
# Every money surface against the seven dimensions, cell by cell, with the checks that prove each. Hand-filled
# evidence, not run output: tools/money-map.mjs reads it and generates tools/money-map.md (item 59).
!tools/money-map.json
# Recorded Section 508 / WCAG findings. Debt, gated on regression — source, not run output.
!tools/a11y-baseline.json
# The register of math defects this board has shipped. Source, not run output: the nightly gate
# reads it as its first stage, so a copy that never reaches main takes the guard with it.
!math-defects.json
# The test tools' exact versions (playwright-core, jsdom and what they pull in), so a fresh clone installs what the
# recorded results used: npm ci. The board itself still has no dependencies (OCIO POA&M P-05, 19 Oct 2026).
!package-lock.json
# Each v2.07 mutation and the check that caught it, so recovery/v208/bin/prove.py can prove any of them again. Source,
# not run output (the v2.08 handoff).
!recovery/v208/v207-proofs.json

# tooling only — the board itself has no dependencies
node_modules/

# Nightly math-validation reports. Run output, not source -- and a failing report embeds suite
# output that can quote fixture figures, so it stays out of the repo.
.math-reports/

# IA review screenshots. Run output, regenerated nightly.
.ia-shots/

# Logo generator output. Run output, not source: the chosen files are copied up a level and committed.
assets/logo/generated/

# Suite copies the provers write beside the suites (their imports are relative) and remove when they finish; a run
# killed part-way leaves them. Never source (recovery/v208/bin/prove.py, tools/export-audit/sweep-shards.mjs).
tools/export-audit/_slim-prove-*.mjs
tools/export-audit/_shard-*.mjs
